[b]0.2.6[/b]
[list]
[*]Co-op treasure chests now ask you to confirm your relic choice in touchscreen mode. Tap a relic to inspect it, then press the checkmark to submit your choice to the party.
[*]You can change your selection before confirming. Leaving the selection screen or starting relic distribution cancels any unconfirmed choice.
[*]Added English and Chinese settings screenshots and refreshed the Workshop description.
[/list]

[list]
[*]触屏模式下，联机宝箱中的遗物选择现在需要二次确认。先点遗物查看，再点确认按钮，才会向队伍提交选择。
[*]确认前可以改选其他遗物。离开选择界面或开始分配遗物时，尚未确认的选择会自动取消。
[*]新增中英文设置截图，并更新了创意工坊介绍。
[/list]
